   "section": "19.5",
   "name": "Permittivity of free space, $\\varepsilon_0 = 8.85 \\times 10^{-12}$ F/m",
   "statement": "The permittivity of free space is the constant $\\varepsilon_0 = 8.85 \\times 10^{-12}$ F/m that sets the capacitance of a parallel plate capacitor with a vacuum between its plates. Its small value is related to the large size of the farad.",
